WHAT IS IN THIS DIRECTORY
-------------------------

Resources only — layouts, drawables, strings and plurals. There is no Java or
Kotlin here. The code that goes with them was translated into Java and lives in
app/src/main/java/com/brouken/player/dtpv/, where each file carries its own
copyright header.

MODIFICATIONS
-------------

This copy has been modified and is not the upstream release. The changes were
made by the Just Player project (https://github.com/moneytoo/Player), from which
Just Player Pro is forked, and were inherited here: the library was brought
in-tree as a local module with its own resources rather than pulled as a
dependency, and its translations were extended.

Just Player Pro has made no further changes to this directory. Its one change to
the double-tap code is recorded in the header of
app/src/main/java/com/brouken/player/dtpv/youtube/YouTubeOverlay.java.
